App logos

The logos of the apps Observarr monitors belong to their projects and are trademarks of their owners. Observarr
shows them only to identify those apps; their use does not imply endorsement. Each is a one-colour version kept
next to its adapter and served at /api/icons/<type>.svg:

  internal/adapters/arr/icons/sonarr.svg    Sonarr    from Simple Icons (CC0-1.0), https://simpleicons.org
  internal/adapters/arr/icons/radarr.svg    Radarr    from Simple Icons (CC0-1.0)
  internal/adapters/rclone/icon.svg         rclone    from Simple Icons (CC0-1.0)
  internal/adapters/arr/icons/prowlarr.svg  Prowlarr  from homarr-labs/dashboard-icons (Apache-2.0)
  internal/adapters/crowdsec/icon.svg       CrowdSec  from homarr-labs/dashboard-icons (Apache-2.0)
  internal/adapters/arr/icons/lidarr.svg    Lidarr    redrawn after homarr-labs/dashboard-icons (Apache-2.0)

Changes to the dashboard-icons files: the colours were flattened to one colour (light paint became cut-outs),
fills were reduced to path data, and the Lidarr mark was redrawn from its outline. dashboard-icons is
https://github.com/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons; its licence is in internal/adapters/LICENSE-dashboard-icons.txt.

